name="+Easybuff - MD Systems Beta"
path="mod/MD-Easybuff-Patch"
dependencies={
	"+Easybuff"
	"Millennium Dawn: A Modern Day Mod"
}
description="Cheat menu for the Millennium Dawn systems that +Easybuff cannot reach. Economy: debt, treasury, tax, corruption, GDP, workforce, money printing and inflation. Politics: internal factions, foreign influence, the ruling party and exact party popularity. Also counter-terrorism, the power grid and energy buildings, off-map buildings, technology unlocks, and repair decisions that restore Millennium Dawn's own limits. REQUIRES two mods: Millennium Dawn: A Modern Day Mod (version 2.0.x) and +Easybuff. Load order: Millennium Dawn first, then +Easybuff, then this mod last. The separate +++Easybuff - Millennium Dawn patch is not required. Unofficial - not affiliated with the Millennium Dawn or +Easybuff teams."
tags={
	"Gameplay"
}
picture="thumbnail.png"
version="0.1.0"
supported_version="1.19.*"
